### Habit Builder - Entity 10-13 API tests
### VS Code extension "REST Client" (by Huachao Mao) lagbe.
### Protiti request er upore "Send Request" e click koro, upor theke niche order e.
### Server chalu thakte hobe: python manage.py runserver

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.access}}

### 1. Register (ekbar-i; abar chalale "email already exists" ashbe, tokhon 2 no chalao)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@habit.com",
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "pass12345",
  "time_zone": "Asia/Dhaka"
}

### 2. Login -> access token nije nije niche use hobe
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@habit.com",
  "password": "pass12345"
}



### ---------------- ENTITY 11 + 12: BADGE / USER_BADGE ----------------

### 3. Shob badge (4 ta ashbe, unlocked: false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/badges/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Amar unlock kora badge (shuru te [])
GET {{baseUrl}}/badges/mine/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Badge banano jay na -> 405 ashbe (thik ache)
POST {{baseUrl}}/badges/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "hack", "name": "Hack" }

### ---------------- ENTITY 10: POINT_TRANSACTION ----------------

### 6. Point summary (shuru te total_points: 0, level: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/summary/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Point history
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Shudhu COMPLETION type
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/?related_type=COMPLETION
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- Habit complete kore point paoa ----------------

### 9. Ekta daily habit banao (aj theke)  -> response er habit_id dekho
# @name habit
POST {{baseUrl}}/habits/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Read",
  "habit_type": "GOOD",
  "target_type": "YES_NO",
  "time_of_day": "MORNING",
  "start_date": "2026-10-18",
  "schedule": { "frequency_type": "DAILY" }
}

### 10. Ajker checklist -> occurrence_id dekho (completion banate lagbe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/habits/checklist/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Completion er API entity 5 er teammate banabe.
### Tader age test korte: Django admin -> Completion records -> Add
###   occurrence: upore er occurrence, progress value: 1, completed at: Today + Now -> Save
### Tarpor 6, 7, 4 abar chalao: total_points 30 (10 + daily bonus 20), "First Step" badge

### ---------------- ENTITY 13: DEVICE_TOKEN ----------------

### 12. Phone token register -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "test-token-123", "platform": "ANDROID" }

### 13. Same token abar -> 200 (duplicate hoy na)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "test-token-123", "platform": "ANDROID" }

### 14. Bhul platform -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "x", "platform": "NOKIA" }

### 15. Amar device list
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Logout e token muche fela -> 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/unregister/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "test-token-123" }

### 17. Login chara -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/